L4:	t2#1#1: vector<u8>
L5:	t2#1#4: &vector<u8>
B0:
	0: LdConst[0](vector<u8>: "abc..)
	1: Call hash::sha3_256(vector<u8>): vector<u8>
	2: StLoc[2](t1#1#1: vector<u8>)
	3: LdConst[4](vector<u8>: 203a..)
	4: StLoc[4](t2#1#1: vector<u8>)
	5: ImmBorrowLoc[2](t1#1#1: vector<u8>)
	6: StLoc[3](t1#1#4: &vector<u8>)
	7: ImmBorrowLoc[4](t2#1#1: vector<u8>)
